{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"AMO","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"阿摩司书","commonName":"阿摩司书","title":"阿摩司书","order":30,"numberOfChapters":9,"sha256":"aea65afe0e5862ee36486d1d8f71c20a1bc4c3aa5415828aa0c58b4c80057d03","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":9,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/9.json","totalNumberOfVerses":146},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["责备以色列人"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"“以色列人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要听耶和华责备你们的话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"责备我从埃及领出来的整个民族的话，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘世上万族之中，我只拣选了你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我要因你们的罪恶而惩罚你们。’”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"若非相约，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"二人怎会同行呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若非捕到猎物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"狮子怎会在林中咆哮呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若非猎获食物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猛狮怎会在洞中吼叫呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若非设下诱饵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"鸟儿怎会落入圈套？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若非捕获什么，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"圈套怎会收起来？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若城中响起号角，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"居民岂不恐惧颤抖？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若灾祸降临城中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"岂不是耶和华的作为？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"的确，主耶和华不向祂的仆人——众先知显明祂的计划，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就不会采取任何行动。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"狮子吼叫，谁不惧怕呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和华已发言，谁能不传讲呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要向亚实突和埃及的城堡宣告：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“你们要聚集到撒玛利亚的山上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看看城中的混乱和暴虐之事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们不知正道，强取豪夺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把掳物囤积在他们的城堡中。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，主耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“敌人要围攻此地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻破你们的防守，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"抢掠你们的城堡。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“牧人从狮口中救羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只能夺回两条腿和一块耳朵。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"同样，住在撒玛利亚的以色列人被救回的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也仅剩一角床榻和一片卧椅。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主——万军之上帝耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“你们要听这话，去警告雅各家。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我追讨以色列人的罪时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要摧毁伯特利的祭坛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将祭坛的角砍落在地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要拆毁过冬和避暑的房屋，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"破坏象牙装饰的宫殿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"推倒许多宏伟的楼宇。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}